    excerpt: { en: "Sapa in summer offers a refreshing escape with cool weather, lush green rice terraces, and rich cultural experiences. This is the perfect time to explore the natural beauty of Northern Vietnam while enjoying local cuisine and authentic village life.", zh: '' },
    intro: { en: ["Whether you are planning a short getaway or a longer journey, understanding what to eat, where to stay, and how to plan your itinerary will help you make the most of your trip."], zh: [] },
