    excerpt: { en: "Autumn in Northwest Vietnam is not only the season of golden rice terraces and breathtaking landscapes, but also a time when the region’s culinary culture reaches its peak. As the weather turns cooler and harvest season begins, local cuisine becomes richer, more aromatic, and deeply rooted in tradition.", zh: '' },
    intro: { en: ["For travelers seeking an authentic cultural experience, exploring the autumn cuisine of Northwest Vietnam is an essential part of the journey."], zh: [] },
